<title>ESTONIA: WATER COMPANY TO ISSUE 40 MLN KROONS IN CPS.</title>
<headline>WATER COMPANY TO ISSUE 40 MLN KROONS IN CPS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tallinn Water and Sewage Company will issue new commercial papers (CP) on April 29 worth 40 million kroons, Hansapank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The three-month CPs will have a yield of 7.43 percent, Ulo Kallas, manager of interest rate products at Hansapank, told Reuters.</p>
<p>The Tallinn city government plans to sell the water company.</p>
<p>Tallinn Heating will also issue new CPs worth 85 million kroons on April 29 with a yield of 8.45 percent.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
